[{"id":184189155,"discussion_id":"2cb190a392b06ade7ba86e2432428937435ea2aa","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复 `InplaceApplyAdagradDA` 在 Ascend950 FP16 场景下的舍入边界精度问题。问题根因是 FP32→FP16 Cast 的 midpoint tie 语义与默认 FP32 Sqrt/Div 的数 ULP 误差叠加，导致 22 个 output0 出现 MARE 超限。修改仅在 FP16 提升计算路径中引入更高精度的运算配置：将三个输出 Cast 的舍入模式改为 `CAST_RINT`（round-to-nearest-even），并为公共 Sqrt 和两条分歧路径的 Div 分别指定 `SqrtAlgo::PRECISION_0ULP_FTZ_FALSE` 与 `DivAlgo::DIFF_COMPENSATION`。FP32 路径未做任何修改，kernel 哈希保持不变。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 FP16 精度配置常量**：在匿名命名空间中添加 `FP16_DIV_CONFIG`（`DivAlgo::DIFF_COMPENSATION`）和 `FP16_SQRT_CONFIG`（`SqrtAlgo::PRECISION_0ULP_FTZ_FALSE`）两个静态常量，供下游运算调用统一引用。\n- **输出 Cast 舍入模式调整**：将 `varOutLocal`、`gAccOutLocal`、`ggAccOutLocal` 三处 `Cast` 的舍入模式从 `RoundMode::CAST_ROUND` 改为 `RoundMode::CAST_RINT`，对齐 round-to-nearest、ties-to-even 语义。\n- **Sqrt 运算精度提升**：将 `Sqrt(varOutF32, ggAccOutF32, n)` 替换为 `Sqrt<float, FP16_SQRT_CONFIG>(...)`，使用 0-ULP 精度且关闭 FTZ 的算法。\n- **Div 运算精度提升**：在 `l1 == 0` 和 `l1 != 0` 两条互斥路径上，将 `Div(varOutF32, scratch, varOutF32, n)` 替换为 `Div<float, FP16_DIV_CONFIG>(...)`，启用差分补偿提升除法精度。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-11T10:25:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-11T10:30:48+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184189160,"discussion_id":"acac1a8937862b311b525cadb9ee4356fd0ab92e","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-11T10:25:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-11T10:55:06+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_ty